## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end data pipeline skills across AWS DVA tooling with a new angle: using Glue Data Catalog for the lake, Firehose for Parquet, and per-device counters for dedupe. Also exercises error handling with a DLQ and LocalStack testing.

## Key Concepts
